{{Stealnotes
| name = MegaMeepo
| is_unacquirable = yes
}}
{{Draftnotes
| name = MegaMeepo
| desc = Unavailable.
}}

 {{Meepcraft|prime=true}}

* Acquiring {{M|Aghanim's Scepter}} unlocks this ability in the {{Spellslot|5|6}}.

* {{Symbol|Meepo|Clones}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}}
** Does nothing and puts the ability on {{M|cooldown}}, when there are no Meepo Clones within the search radius.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** The following Clones do not travel to the Prime:
**** {{M|Hidden|x}} Meepos.
**** {{M|Invulnerable|x}} Meepos.
*** Does not {{M|disjoint}} traveling Clones upon cast.
*** {{Symbol|Meepo|Clones}}
**** Grants the traveling Clones the following ability effects:
***** {{M|Hidden}}
***** {{M|Invulnerable}}

* Once the mount is completed, all current {{A|Meepo|Meepo Clones}} are also periodically moved along with the {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}} Prime. This affects the following things:
** {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}}
*** The Clones reappear in the Prime's current location upon MegaMeepo ending in any way.
*** All {{M|auras}} are now bestowed and centered around the Prime.
*** All ability effects (e.g. {{A|Smoke of Deceit|Disguise}}) now interacts with the Prime's presence.
** The following sources cause the affected Clone to be selectively removed from the stack and reappear:
*** {{A|Io|Relocate}}
*** {{A|Keeper of the Light|Recall}}
*** Neither change the MegaMeepo's height nor the Meepo Clone's stack position.

* {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}}
** Grants the Prime {{M|attribute}} bonus corresponding to the highest attribute value, and is defined as:
*** {{cf|expr}} {{Code|BonusAttribute {{=}} ([[Wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌊]]HighestNatural[[Attribute]][[wikipedia:Floor and ceiling functions|⌋]] × {{#var:MegaMeepo value2}}) × Σ[[Meepo#Divided We Stand|Clones]]Stacked}}
*** The following attribute sources affect the MegaMeepo stack:
**** Base attributes.
**** Attribute gain of levels.
** The Prime keeps his {{M|current health}} and {{M|current mana}} percentages upon losing MegaMeepo form.

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:MegaMeepo icon0}}
| desc = Primary Meepo mounts all other Meepos in a 600 radius around him on top of his shoulders. While in this form, he gains 40% of the other Meepo stats and can Fling them at enemies, dealing damage and slowing them.<br><br>When cast, Earthbind generates additional nets and Poof deals 50% more damage for each Meepo on top.
}}
* All {{A|Meepo|Meepo Clones}} within the radius has a {{#var:MegaMeepo basic1}}-{{M|projectile speed}} traveling to the {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}} Prime.

* The {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}} Prime still wields its weapon and its always placecd at the bottom of the stack.
** Other {{A|Meepo|Meepo Clones}}, except the highest Meepo Clone, visually raises their hands up visually carrying the other Meepo Clones above them on the stack.

* attribute math

