{{Draftnotes
| name = Divided We Stand
| desc = Unavailable.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Divided We Stand icon0}}
| desc = Meepo summons another Meepo, which levels up and shares items and experience with the main Meepo. Ability cooldowns are independent, but items share cooldowns between Meepos, except Teleport Scrolls.<br><br>Damage, attack speed, health, mana, regeneration, mana burn, and proc chance bonuses from items are distributed equally among the amount of Meepos, making them 50% less effective.<br><br>If any Meepo dies, they all die.
}}
{{Meepcraft}}

* {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}}
** All [[Meepo/Responses|hero responses]] are used by the Prime only, unless when stated otherwise.
*** Responses marked as not-repeating are still limited to once per match, not once per Meepo.

* {{Symbol|Meepo|Clones}}
** The Clones' hero responses are slightly higher pitched up, and each Clone has individual response cooldowns.
** Grants the following bonuses:
*** Has {{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1-v1)|v1={{#var:Divided We Stand value5}}|%}} {{M|magic resistance|x}}.
*** Divided We Stand increases the total {{M|magic resistance|x}} by {{calc|(1-v1)*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}*10|v1={{#var:Divided We Stand value5}}|%}} per 10 {{M|intelligence}} points.

* {{Symbol|Experience}}
