*** No ally heroes:
**** {{Symbol|Meepo|Clones}} {{Code|{{#var:Divided We Stand value4}} × ΣXP}}
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} The remaining [[experience]] is not granted to anyone else.
*** 1x ally hero:
**** {{Symbol|Meepo|Clones}} {{Code|{{#expr:{{#var:Divided We Stand value4}}/2}} × ΣXP}}
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} {{Code|{{#expr:(1-{{#var:Divided We Stand value4}}/2)}} × ΣXP}}
**** If the {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}} Prime the only ally hero, {{hi|Meepo}} gains all of the experience.
*** With 2/3/4/5 ally heroes, the experience distribution within the radius is as follows:
**** {{Symbol|Meepo|Clones}} {{Code|{{#vardefineecho:CXP|{{calc|({{#var:Divided We Stand value4}}/(v1+1))|v1=2/3/4/5}}}} × ΣXP}}
**** {{Symbol|Affect|Ally}} {{Code|{{#vardefineecho:PXP|{{calc|((1-{{#var:Divided We Stand value4}}/v1)/v1) round3|v1=2/3/4/5}}}} × ΣXP per ally}}
**** If the {{Symbol|Meepo|Prime}} is one of the ally heroes, {{hi|Meepo}} gains {{Code|{{calc|v1+v2 round3|v1={{#var:CXP}}|v2={{#var:PXP}}}} × ΣXP}} within the radius.-->

